---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Take the wheel" description="Drive a small 3D town with a signalled junction, four roundabouts and left-hand traffic where red lights are optional and pedestrians cross wherever they like. Or hand it to the autopilot.">
  <div class="wrap drive-page">
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="label">Take the wheel</p>
      <h1 class="h1">A town where nobody follows the rules</h1>
      <p class="lead">A signalled crossroads and four roundabouts, with left-hand traffic. Drivers jump reds and cut in, autos stop without warning, riders come the wrong way along the kerb, and pedestrians cross wherever they like. Drive it yourself, or hand it to the autopilot and watch it cope.</p>
    </header>

    <figure class="figure" data-drive>
      <div class="stage" data-stage>
        <div class="hud hud-tl">
          <p class="speed"><span data-hud-speed>0</span><small>km/h</small></p>
          <p class="hud-line" data-hud-mode>Autopilot</p>
          <p class="hud-line" data-hud-signal>Signal</p>
        </div>
        <p class="hud hud-tr hud-line" data-hud-you></p>
        <p class="hud hud-br hud-line" data-hud-world></p>
        <p class="toast" data-hud-toast hidden></p>
        <button class="start" type="button" data-start>Start driving</button>
        <div class="touch" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="pad">
            <button type="button" data-touch="left" tabindex="-1">◀</button>
            <button type="button" data-touch="right" tabindex="-1">▶</button>
          </div>
          <div class="pad">
            <button type="button" data-touch="brake" tabindex="-1">Brake</button>
            <button type="button" data-touch="gas" tabindex="-1">Go</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="fallback meta" data-fallback hidden>Your browser couldn't start WebGL, so the town can't be drawn here.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bar">
        <div class="acts" role="group" aria-label="Simulation controls">
          <button type="button" class="toggle" data-act="auto" aria-pressed="true">Autopilot</button>
          <button type="button" class="toggle" data-act="cam">Camera</button>
          <button type="button" class="toggle" data-act="reset">Reset</button>
          <button type="button" class="toggle stop" data-act="exit" hidden>Stop driving</button>
        </div>
        <p class="meta keys"><kbd>↑</kbd><kbd>↓</kbd><kbd>←</kbd><kbd>→</kbd> or <kbd>W</kbd><kbd>A</kbd><kbd>S</kbd><kbd>D</kbd> drive · <kbd>Space</kbd> brake · <kbd>P</kbd> autopilot · <kbd>C</kbd> camera · <kbd>R</kbd> reset · <kbd>Esc</kbd> stop</p>
      </div>
      <figcaption><b>How it works</b> Every road ends in a roundabout, so the town loops forever. Each driver has their own preferred speed, following distance and appetite for red lights, and drives with the Intelligent Driver Model: keep a gap to whatever is ahead, unless you'd rather not. The autopilot steers with pure pursuit along its lane, stops for red lights, and brakes for anything in its path, pedestrians included. The dashed amber line is its plan. Pedestrian hits, contacts, near misses and red lights are counted top right; what everyone else got up to is counted bottom right.</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .drive-page { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-8); }
  .stage { position: relative; height: min(78vh, 920px); min-height: 400px; background: var(--paper-raised); border: 1px solid var(--line); overflow: hidden; touch-action: none; }
  .stage :global(canvas) { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100% !important; height: 100% !important; outline: none; }
  .stage :global(canvas:focus-visible) { outline: 2px solid var(--lane-ink); outline-offset: -2px; }
  .hud { position: absolute; margin: 0; pointer-events: none; font-family: var(--font-mono); color: #f5f5f1; }
  .hud-tl { top: 12px; left: 12px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; align-items: flex-start; }
  .hud-tr { top: 12px; right: 12px; }
  .hud-br { right: 12px; bottom: 12px; max-width: calc(100% - 24px); text-align: right; }
  .hud-line { margin: 0; font-size: var(--fs-xs); line-height: 1.3; background: rgba(16, 18, 20, .7); padding: 6px 8px; }
  .speed { margin: 0; display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px; background: rgba(16, 18, 20, .7); padding: 6px 10px; }
  .speed span { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; font-size: calc(var(--fs-h1) * .8); line-height: 1; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; min-width: 2ch; }
  .speed small { font-size: var(--fs-xs); }
  .toast { position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 56px; transform: translateX(-50%); margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--fs-sm); background: var(--lane); color: var(--on-lane); padding: 8px 12px; pointer-events: none; max-width: calc(100% - 24px); text-align: center; }
  .start { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--fs-sm); font-weight: 600; background: var(--lane); color: var(--on-lane); border: 0; padding: 12px 20px; cursor: pointer; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px rgba(240, 180, 41, .25); }
  .start:hover { box-shadow: 0 0 0 10px rgba(240, 180, 41, .25); }
  .fallback { position: absolute; inset: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: var(--space-6); text-align: center; }
  .touch { position: absolute; left: 12px; right: 12px; bottom: 96px; display: none; justify-content: space-between; pointer-events: none; }
  .pad { display: flex; gap: 10px; pointer-events: auto; }
  .touch button { width: 64px; height: 56px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--fs-sm); font-weight: 600; background: rgba(16, 18, 20, .6); color: #f5f5f1; border: 1px solid rgba(245, 245, 241, .4); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); touch-action: none; user-select: none; -webkit-user-select: none; }
  .touch button[data-touch="gas"] { background: var(--lane); color: var(--on-lane); border-color: var(--lane); }
  @media (pointer: coarse) { .touch { display: flex; } }
  .bar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-3) var(--space-6); }
  .acts { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--space-2); }
  .acts .toggle[aria-pressed="true"] { color: var(--on-lane); background: var(--lane); border-color: var(--lane); }
  .acts .stop { color: var(--ink); border-color: var(--ink-muted); }
  kbd { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: calc(var(--fs-xs) * .9); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom-width: 2px; padding: 0 4px; margin: 0 1px; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); color: var(--ink); }
  @media (pointer: coarse) { .keys { display: none; } }
</style>

<script>
  import '../scripts/drive';
</script>
